## 5.6 DEX Interaction Profiling Module
Purpose:
- Classify transfer context around protocol interactions
- Identify temporal overlap and behavioral similarity signals

## 5.7 Network Visualization Module
Purpose:
- Convert computed entities and relationships into an interactive graph
- Enable fast analyst comprehension of complex relationship topology

Key principles:
- Semantic node/edge typing
- Visual distinction between targets, intermediaries, and funders
