## 6. End-to-End Analysis Pipeline (Conceptual)

```pseudo
INPUT: target_wallets[]

targets = validate_and_normalize(target_wallets)
events  = ingest_wallet_event_windows(targets)

transfers = normalize_transfers(events)

direct_edges     = extract_direct_edges(transfers, targets)
shared_funders   = detect_shared_funding_sources(transfers, targets)
one_hop_paths    = infer_intermediate_paths(transfers, targets)
funding_lineage  = map_funding_origins(transfers, targets)
dex_profiles     = classify_protocol_interactions(transfers)

evidence_bundle = aggregate(
  direct_edges,
  shared_funders,
  one_hop_paths,
  funding_lineage,
  dex_profiles
)

graph_model = build_investigation_graph(evidence_bundle)

OUTPUT: structured_investigation_report(graph_model, evidence_bundle)
```

This representation is intentionally simplified and excludes proprietary logic.

